Package: RUMBLE
Type: Package
Title: Robust Unified Microbiome Biomarker Learning Engine
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Lucas", "Fett", email = "lucas.fett2021@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-0596-3991"))
Description: RUMBLE implements a consensus machine learning framework for
    identifying microbial biomarkers from high-throughput sequencing data.
    The package integrates Random Forest and XGBoost classifiers via the
    tidymodels ecosystem, provides model-agnostic interpretability through
    SHAP values and permutation importance (via DALEX), and adds a tree-
    specific ecological interpretation layer based on TreeSHAP interaction
    values with synergy, redundancy and independence decomposition. It
    handles compositional microbiome data using centered log-ratio (CLR)
    transformations.
